Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿我的仁慈  胜过\N{\rEng}"My mercy...prevails...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的怒火\N{\rEng}over my wrath."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰瑞\N{\rEng}Jerry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  朱迪斯\N{\rEng}S'up, Jude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\rEng}Hey, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切还好吗\N{\rEng}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是来吃你们做的灰胡桃煎锅蛋糕的\N{\rEng}Just came for some of that butternut skillet cake you guys make.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从神之国远道而来就为了吃甜点吗\N{\rEng}You rode out from the Kingdom for dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.57,0:00:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Hells yah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果你被拉来砌墙了\N{\rEng}You got roped into masonry duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西迪克\N{\rEng}Siddiq, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没法拒绝他\N{\rEng}Dude's impossible to say no to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我继续干活了\N{\rEng}Back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快走\N{\rEng}Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.49,0:01:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用这样做\N{\rEng}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\rEng}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先躲这里  等我和我爸爸谈\N{\rEng}It's just ‭'til I can talk to my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他还不回来  我们就去找他\N{\rEng}If he's not back soon, we'll meet him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他们会和他在一起\N{\rEng}Hopefully, they'll be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩呢\N{\rEng}What about Michonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}我得亲眼去看\N抱歉我没有先道别  我很快回来\N米琼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}米琼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}伊妮德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见了吗\N{\rEng}You seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北边收到  有枪声\N{\rEng}North copies. Got shots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西边也是  他们在干什么\N{\rEng}West, too. What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行尸还没杀完  他们就会用光弹药\N{\rEng}They'll run outta ammo before they run outta walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\rEng}I got eyes on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南边结束通话\N{\rEng}South out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想开一条路\N{\rEng}They're trying to make a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用尸体挡住行尸\N{\rEng}Blocking out the walkers with bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要出来了\N{\rEng}They're gonna get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得告诉所有人\N{\rEng}Man, we need to tell everybody --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南边遭到攻击\N{\rEng}South down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去  大家都出去\N{\rEng}Get out! Everybody, get out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  喂\N{\rEng}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见了\N{\rEng}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的线把它绊倒了  我来\N{\rEng}It got tripped up on my wire. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小屋就在前面  在林木线之外\N{\rEng}The cottage is just ahead, out of the tree-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有熟铁围栏\N{\rEng}It's got a wrought-iron fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屋里有食物和水\N{\rEng}There's food and water inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军不知道那里\N{\rEng}The Saviors don't know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我带回以西结之前  你们在那很安全\N{\rEng}You'll be safe there until I make it back with Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人对付他们所有人吗\N{\rEng}You versus all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们毫无胜算\N{\rEng}They don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去的不止是卡萝尔\N{\rEng}It's not just Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我\N{\rEng}I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\rEng}No. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们杀了我哥哥\N{\rEng}They killed my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让他们也杀了你\N{\rEng}And I'm not gonna let 'em kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以的\N{\rEng}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.91,0:10:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\rEng}I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根教我用棍\N{\rEng}Morgan taught me the stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你教我用枪\N{\rEng}You taught me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\rEng}It's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不...\N{\rEng}I-I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\rEng}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-怎么回事  -爸爸\N{\rEng}- How... ‭- Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\rEng}...it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\rEng}It's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前不确定你能否及时赶回来\N{\rEng}I wasn't sure if you'd make it back before...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但为了以防万一\N{\rEng}But just in case, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想确保我跟你道别\N{\rEng}...I wanted to make sure I was able to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是他们干的\N{\rEng}No. It's them. It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不...\N{\rEng}They -- They don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.89,0:12:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...\N{\rEng}It wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.16,0:12:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不  -我被咬了\N{\rEng}- No. - ‭I got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在带人回来\N{\rEng}I was bringing someone back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫西迪克\N{\rEng}His name's Siddiq.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们之前在加油站见过他\N{\rEng}We saw him at that gas station, before...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是救世军干的\N{\rEng}It wasn't the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情只是发生了\N{\rEng}It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被咬了\N{\rEng}I got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根现在要杀了你\N{\rEng}Negan's gonna kill you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说  他要杀了你\N{\rEng}I said he's gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我无法阻止\N{\rEng}And there's nothing I can do to stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听见我说话了吗\N{\rEng}Hey. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让我的人获得了自由\N{\rEng}I ferried my people to freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会怎样并不重要\N{\rEng}What befalls me now matters not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那很重要  笨蛋\N{\rEng}No. It matters, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你  以西结\N{\rEng}I liked you, Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\rEng}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂你没法做得更好\N{\rEng}You got that you couldn't do better than you had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你接受了现实\N{\rEng}You accepted things for what they were,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没什么奇思异想\N{\rEng}and you didn't get any big ideas in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后瑞克来了  让你有了鬼点子\N{\rEng}And then Rick went ‭and planted one right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果就成了这样\N{\rEng}And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情越来越糟糕\N{\rEng}Shit's getting shittier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你要死了\N{\rEng}And you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了一个能让我安心的选择\N{\rEng}I made a choice I could live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在轮到你做了\N{\rEng}Now it's your turn to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\rEng}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没有足够人手守卫所有围墙\N{\rEng}‭They don't have enough people to guard all the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但他们的确有人手\N{\rEng}No, but they do have people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-以西结也在他们手上  -我看见了\N{\rEng}- And they have Ezekiel. - I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被关在这里的另一边\N{\rEng}They got him on the other side of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能干掉他们\N{\rEng}We can take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个接一个\N{\rEng}One by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  如果我们攻击一个\N{\rEng}No, if we hit one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人都可能发现\N{\rEng}that could call them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好避开他们  直到无法避开\N{\rEng}It's better just to avoid them until we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:03.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\rEng}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也在这里\N{\rEng}He's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\rEng}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见他了吗  他们抓到他了吗\N{\rEng}Did you see him? Do they have him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我看见他往这边跑  然后不见了\N{\rEng}Yeah, I saw him run this way, and then he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他会躲起来的\N{\rEng}But he'll hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会跟他们短兵相接\N{\rEng}He won't take them on face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得现在行动\N{\rEng}We have to do this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不得不干掉他们  就下手\N{\rEng}So if we have to take them, we take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好些吗\N{\rEng}Is that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带了这些\N{\rEng}I, um, I got these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非处方非类固醇抗炎药\N{\rEng}They're over-the-counter, non-steroidal anti-inflammatories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:16:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能帮助退烧\N{\rEng}They'll, um -- they'll help a little with the fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我爸妈就有效\N{\rEng}They did for my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.37,0:16:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你拿去吧\N{\rEng}Please take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你儿子\N{\rEng}Your son...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.77,0:16:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他该吃这些药\N{\rEng}he should have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是医生吗\N{\rEng}You're a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前是住院医生\N{\rEng}I was a resident... before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫西迪克\N{\rEng}Your name is Siddiq?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他是医生吗\N{\rEng}Did you know he was a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你带他回来的原因吗\N{\rEng}Is that why you brought him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一个人活不下去\N{\rEng}He wasn't gonna make it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他需要我们\N{\rEng}He needed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是原因\N{\rEng}That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是加油站那个人\N{\rEng}He was the one at the gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水  给他喝水\N{\rEng}Water. Give him water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢点  好吗\N{\rEng}Easy. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢点  慢点\N{\rEng}Slowly, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\rEng}Make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们停下\N{\rEng}Make them stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.15,0:17:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我做不到  -你可以\N{\rEng}- I can't. - ‭You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他们的一员\N{\rEng}You're one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会听你的\N{\rEng}They'll listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过山顶寨是安全的  对吧\N{\rEng}You said that Hilltop's safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得把大家带到那里去\N{\rEng}We need to get everybody there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以把卡尔带过去\N{\rEng}We can get Carl there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们以为你们逃到了林子里\N{\rEng}And they think all of you got away in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今他们正在外面搜寻你们\N{\rEng}They're out there, looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们看见我们往西边去了\N{\rEng}They saw us go West,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们不能去西边\N{\rEng}so we won't go West.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们最明智的选择是待在这里\N{\rEng}Your best chance is to stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他们离开\N{\rEng}until they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们找到了我们  我们就死定了\N{\rEng}They find us here, we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就快消停了\N{\rEng}They're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定的\N{\rEng}They gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的目标不是毁掉这个地方\N{\rEng}It wasn't about destroying the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没有足够的弹药那么做\N{\rEng}They don't have the ammo for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:19:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等风头过去\N{\rEng}After they let up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他们离开之后\N{\rEng}after they're gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就走\N{\rEng}that's when we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们等\N{\rEng}We wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定去山顶寨是最好的选择吗\N{\rEng}You sure going to Hilltop's the best plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有更好的选择吗\N{\rEng}You got a better one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们所有人  聚在同一个地方\N{\rEng}All of you in one place, together...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们所有人聚在一起...\N{\rEng}All of us together...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将成为他们最可怕的噩梦\N{\rEng}We'll be their worst damn nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如我们要绕开他们\N{\rEng}‭If we don't go through 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就必须穿过院子\N{\rEng}we gotta go through the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴露在外\N{\rEng}Exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.87,0:20:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该动手了\N{\rEng}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该动手了\N{\rEng}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我来吗\N{\rEng}You want me to just do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\rEng}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.93,0:21:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全干掉\N{\rEng}Got all of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.77,0:21:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然他们有可能抓住亨利\N{\rEng}They could've found Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rEng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心的不是他们\N{\rEng}I'm not worried about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  小子们\N{\rEng}Come on, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别磨磨唧唧的\N{\rEng}Get the damn gum off your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发\N{\rEng}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会出乱子吗  以西结\N{\rEng}Is it gonna go bad, Ezekiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会出什么岔子\N{\rEng}Is this going to turn into something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.44,0:22:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是今晚的编剧  加文\N{\rEng}You are the author of this night, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚的结局该和你创造的开头相称\N{\rEng}Its close shall be fashioned by your start.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走了\N{\rEng}You left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该在休息的\N{\rEng}You were supposed to be resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.25,0:22:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不累\N{\rEng}I'm not tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.12,0:22:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上去光彩照人\N{\rEng}You look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.77,0:22:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切必须停止  米琼恩\N{\rEng}It's gotta stop, Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.91,0:22:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来不应该是眼下这个情况的\N{\rEng}It's not supposed to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道本来可以更好的\N{\rEng}I know it can be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.25,0:23:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们听着像是消停了\N{\rEng}Sounds like they're letting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.81,0:23:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你说得对\N{\rEng}Looks like you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.08,0:23:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们撤了\N{\rEng}They're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.76,0:23:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\rEng}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我去看看吗\N{\rEng}Want me to go take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.22,0:23:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里\N{\rEng}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总比住在化工厂好\N{\rEng}...sure as shit gonna beat living in that chemical dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要那间房\N{\rEng}‭Hell, you want that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.57,0:24:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得和我打一架才行\N{\rEng}you're gonna have to fight me for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.27,0:24:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管了\N{\rEng}Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.14,0:24:28.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管了\N{\rEng}Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.54,0:24:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.16,0:25:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给以西结留点空间\N{\rEng}Leave some room for Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.94,0:25:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他拿个枕头之类的\N{\rEng}Get him a pillow or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.14,0:25:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他最后一程了\N{\rEng}It's gonna be his last ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少让他舒服点\N{\rEng}Let's at least try to make him comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.89,0:25:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你努力  努力  不断努力\N{\rEng}You try, and you try, and you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.82,0:25:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你期望  期望  不断期望\N{\rEng}and you hope, and you hope, and you hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.78,0:25:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只希望一切最终能尘埃落定\N{\rEng}Just wantin' things to finally just settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:37.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,努力实现所谓该死的平衡\N{\rEng}Achieve some goddamn, hard-fought equilibrium.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.81,0:25:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不\N{\rEng}But, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.81,0:25:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远会变成这样\N{\rEng}It always comes down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.06,0:25:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远会变得黑暗  丑陋\N{\rEng}It always has to get dark and ugly...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.71,0:25:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不人道\N{\rEng}and inhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:25:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我不喜欢这样  对吗\N{\rEng}You know I don't like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.97,0:26:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在回头还来得及\N{\rEng}It is not too late to walk back from something decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.74,0:26:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回头了\N{\rEng}You did,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.27,0:26:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你的下场\N{\rEng}and look where it got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.09,0:26:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜克  保利  你们在哪\N{\rEng}Duke. Paulie. Where you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别折腾了  赶紧拿起对讲机回话\N{\rEng}Stop pickin' dingles, grab your walkie, and respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.28,0:26:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戈麦斯\N{\rEng}Gomez?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戈麦斯\N{\rEng}Gomez!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在回头还来得及\N{\rEng}It is not too late to walk back from something decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.09,0:26:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  来了\N{\rEng}Shit. There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.35,0:26:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他带进去  快点\N{\rEng}Get him inside. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.11,0:27:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我调整了这些厨具\N{\rEng}I calibrate this cooker properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.61,0:27:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想烤多少苹果就烤多少\N{\rEng}we'll be lousy with baked apples ad infinitum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.35,0:27:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我诚邀你当我的副厨\N{\rEng}It would be my honor if you considered to be the sous to my chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者我可以当副厨  你当主厨\N{\rEng}Or I could be said sous, and you shall surely chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.22,0:27:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前  这只黄苹果归你了\N{\rEng}'Til then, this Golden Delicious has your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.08,0:28:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  尤金\N{\rEng}Thanks, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.54,0:28:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.46,0:28:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军走了\N{\rEng}The Saviors are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.41,0:28:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以带大家去山顶寨\N{\rEng}We can get everyone to Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.70,0:28:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以送卡尔去\N{\rEng}We can get Carl there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.62,0:28:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔  不行\N{\rEng}Carl? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.67,0:28:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达里尔可以搞一辆车\N{\rEng}Daryl can get one of the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:47.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔撑不住...\N{\rEng}Carl won't make --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能离开这里\N{\rEng}He can't leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.41,0:28:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我得和他待在一起  -瑞克\N{\rEng}- I have to stay with him. - Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.77,0:28:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他撑不住\N{\rEng}He can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.03,0:28:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须留下来\N{\rEng}I have to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.96,0:29:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们都留下来\N{\rEng}We'll both stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.30,0:29:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能...\N{\rEng}Will you --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.97,0:29:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能带朱迪斯走吗\N{\rEng}Will you take Judith?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.27,0:29:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她得去那里\N{\rEng}She needs to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.99,0:29:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她...\N{\rEng}If she...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.38,0:29:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果...\N{\rEng}If...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.10,0:29:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出事...\N{\rEng}happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.86,0:29:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带她去\N{\rEng}I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.28,0:29:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带她去  我会保护好她\N{\rEng}I'll get her there. I'll keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.44,0:29:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧\N{\rEng}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.83,0:29:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我和她告别\N{\rEng}Let me say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.06,0:29:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要乖乖的  好吗\N{\rEng}You be good, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.03,0:29:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了米琼恩\N{\rEng}For Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.47,0:30:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了爸爸\N{\rEng}For Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.69,0:30:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要尊重他\N{\rEng}You gotta honor him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.59,0:30:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和你说话的时候得听话\N{\rEng}Listen when he tells you stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.19,0:30:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用每次都听\N{\rEng}You don't have to always.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.75,0:30:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候孩子得教爸妈怎么做\N{\rEng}Sometimes, kids got to show their parents the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.41,0:30:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这帽子本来是我爸爸的\N{\rEng}This was Dad's before it was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.59,0:30:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是你的了\N{\rEng}Now it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.69,0:30:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不好...\N{\rEng}I don't know...Just --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.73,0:30:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这帽子\N{\rEng}Just having it and...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.65,0:30:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总让我感觉爸爸就在身边\N{\rEng}It always kept Dad with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.16,0:30:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我觉得自己和他一样强大\N{\rEng}It made me feel as strong as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.78,0:31:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它帮了我许多\N{\rEng}It helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许以后也能帮到你\N{\rEng}Maybe it'll help you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.96,0:31:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在妈妈死之前\N{\rEng}Before Mom died...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.72,0:31:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她告诉我  我会战胜这个世界\N{\rEng}...she told me that I was gonna beat this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.53,0:31:31.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没做到\N{\rEng}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.43,0:31:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你会做到的\N{\rEng}But you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.09,0:31:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你会的\N{\rEng}I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.26,0:31:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\rEng}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.58,0:31:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人\N{\rEng}These people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.91,0:31:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你救了他们所有人\N{\rEng}You saved them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.82,0:32:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你的功劳\N{\rEng}That's all you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.90,0:32:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮我纪念我的母亲\N{\rEng}You were helping me honor my mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.78,0:32:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅是你的\N{\rEng}Not just yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.59,0:32:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我的母亲\N{\rEng}Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.58,0:32:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带我来这里\N{\rEng}You brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.01,0:32:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给了我机会\N{\rEng}You gave me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.12,0:32:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我永远无法报答你\N{\rEng}I know I can never repay you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.43,0:32:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我可以纪念你\N{\rEng}but I can honor you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.07,0:32:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以行动  向你的队伍  朋友\N{\rEng}by showing your people, your f-friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.81,0:32:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家人\N{\rEng}your your family
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.87,0:33:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明你的牺牲没有白费\N{\rEng}that what you did wasn't for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.75,0:33:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有效果的\N{\rEng}That it mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.24,0:33:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有意义的\N{\rEng}That it... that it meant something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.17,0:33:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为确实有\N{\rEng}Because it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.85,0:33:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我要做的\N{\rEng}So that's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.01,0:33:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会纪念你  卡尔\N{\rEng}I'm gonna honor you, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.63,0:33:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\rEng}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得与我们同行了\N{\rEng}You're stuck with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.41,0:34:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.62,0:34:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没多少人  因为没剩下多少人了\N{\rEng}There can't be a lot of 'em 'cause there aren't a lot left.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.02,0:34:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们占领了屋子  入口难攻\N{\rEng}We got room for us and controlled access.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.18,0:34:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家堵住门  快\N{\rEng}Force projected on the doors, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管它什么情况  我们都要解决\N{\rEng}We end this, whatever the hell it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.11,0:34:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须收拾好这烂摊子  否则有棍棒之灾\N{\rEng}I gotta settle this shit under the penalty of that goddamn bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.92,0:34:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必\N{\rEng}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.50,0:34:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再扯了  好吗\N{\rEng}Shut up about that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.66,0:34:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现实如此  大势已去\N{\rEng}This is it! It is too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.78,0:34:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是编剧  你是死人\N{\rEng}I'm the "Author," You're the dead man,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.32,0:34:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已成定局\N{\rEng}and that's how it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.83,0:34:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我还能变成别的角色吗\N{\rEng}You think I can be someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我\N{\rEng}This is who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.86,0:35:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我活你死  这就是现实\N{\rEng}I live, you die...this is what this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.48,0:35:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为避免祸端做出的那些让步\N{\rEng}The petty compromises I made to avoid conflict
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.75,0:35:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是以保全我的子民为名义\N{\rEng}were always done in the name of saving my people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.70,0:35:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我现在明白\N{\rEng}Now I realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.35,0:35:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在救你的命\N{\rEng}I was saving yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.73,0:35:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到此为止\N{\rEng}No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.06,0:35:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投降  不然我杀了他\N{\rEng}Give up, or he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.75,0:37:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.66,0:37:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根  我们该走了\N{\rEng}Morgan, ‭we should take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.52,0:37:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不用走\N{\rEng}We don't need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.49,0:37:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\rEng}All of them are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.45,0:38:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\rEng}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.89,0:38:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望我死后你悲伤\N{\rEng}I don't want you to be sad after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.24,0:38:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-卡尔  -或者愤怒\N{\rEng}- Carl... - ‭Or angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.66,0:38:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须坚强\N{\rEng}You're gonna have to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.03,0:38:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我爸\N{\rEng}For my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.57,0:38:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了朱迪斯\N{\rEng}For Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.89,0:38:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了你自己\N{\rEng}For yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.28,0:38:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\rEng}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.46,0:39:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别背负这些\N{\rEng}Don't carry this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.01,0:39:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别背负这部分\N{\rEng}Not this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.28,0:39:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友  米琼恩\N{\rEng}You're my best friend, Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.98,0:39:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是我最好的朋友\N{\rEng}You're mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.20,0:39:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友\N{\rEng}You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.12,0:39:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\rEng}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什么\N{\rEng}With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.45,0:39:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他抬出去\N{\rEng}Getting him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.35,0:40:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得停了\N{\rEng}We need to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.26,0:40:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面有个房子  我们可以的\N{\rEng}The house up ahead. We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.28,0:40:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\rEng}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.53,0:40:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  把我放这就行\N{\rEng}It's okay. Just put me down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.38,0:40:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\rEng}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.15,0:40:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不  我们会走到的  -求你了\N{\rEng}- No. We'll make it. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.94,0:40:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里\N{\rEng}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.82,0:42:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\rEng}Thanks...for...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.67,0:42:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我走这么远\N{\rEng}for getting me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.32,0:42:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I'm...I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.48,0:42:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\rEng}I-I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.54,0:42:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想让你在外面\N{\rEng}I didn't...‭I didn't want you out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.61,0:42:22.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}‭No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  让我走到今天\N{\rEng}No...for getting me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.15,0:42:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我活到现在\N{\rEng}For...for making it
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.41,0:42:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我成为...\N{\rEng}so I could be who...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.50,0:42:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这样的人\N{\rEng}who I wound up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.64,0:42:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在监狱的时候\N{\rEng}Back at the prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.19,0:42:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被袭击时\N{\rEng}when we got attacked...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.49,0:43:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个小孩\N{\rEng}...there was a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.59,0:43:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我大一点\N{\rEng}a little older than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.96,0:43:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有一把枪\N{\rEng}He had a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.66,0:43:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他...\N{\rEng}He was --
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.22,0:43:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正要放下枪\N{\rEng}He was starting to put it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.84,0:43:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\rEng}and I-I s--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.94,0:43:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开枪打了他\N{\rEng}I shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.04,0:43:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正要投降\N{\rEng}He was -- He was giving it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.45,0:43:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我...\N{\rEng}and I...I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.57,0:43:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开枪打了他\N{\rEng}I shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.43,0:43:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想到了他\N{\rEng}I think about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.89,0:43:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对他做的事\N{\rEng}What I did to him
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.78,0:43:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有...\N{\rEng}and how --
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.53,0:43:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么简单就杀了他\N{\rEng}how easy it was to just...kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.37,0:43:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个疯子\N{\rEng}You're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.28,0:44:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有疯子才会这样做\N{\rEng}Only a sick man would do it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.44,0:44:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我想这样吗\N{\rEng}You think I wanted this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.79,0:44:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没别的选择\N{\rEng}There wasn't a lot on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.51,0:44:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我的小队很好\N{\rEng}I ran a good crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.81,0:44:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说话算话\N{\rEng}I kept my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.72,0:44:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去问以西结  我说话算话\N{\rEng}You ask Ezekiel -- I kept my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.57,0:44:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以...\N{\rEng}You -- You could --
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.56,0:44:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以回山顶寨\N{\rEng}You could go back to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.30,0:44:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里没沦陷\N{\rEng}It's still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.30,0:44:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们被放了一马\N{\rEng}They're keeping them going.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.73,0:44:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头吧\N{\rEng}Just turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.71,0:44:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你能打赢尼根吗\N{\rEng}You think you can beat Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.25,0:44:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打不赢\N{\rEng}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.93,0:44:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以回到过去的状态\N{\rEng}We can go back to how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.06,0:44:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以回到...\N{\rEng}We can go back --
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.20,0:44:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.17,0:45:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔  不\N{\rEng}Carl, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.63,0:45:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.17,0:45:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生过的事\N{\rEng}What happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.34,0:45:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失去的东西\N{\rEng}what you'd lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.57,0:45:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些你不得不...\N{\rEng}All those things you had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.80,0:45:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得不做的事\N{\rEng}All those thing you had to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.08,0:45:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是个...\N{\rEng}You -- You -- You -- You were just --
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.55,0:45:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是个孩子\N{\rEng}You were just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.10,0:45:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了\N{\rEng}And you saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.94,0:45:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那对我的影响\N{\rEng}What it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.09,0:45:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人变得多么简单\N{\rEng}How -- How easy it got.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.23,0:45:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了这么多人  就为了那孩子吗\N{\rEng}You just killed all those men because of the kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.21,0:45:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我不会让你释怀\N{\rEng}Killing me won't make any of it go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.41,0:45:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明早醒来依然会难受\N{\rEng}You'll still wake up to the same shit tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.53,0:46:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来\N{\rEng}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.22,0:46:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来\N{\rEng}‭Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.23,0:46:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你变了\N{\rEng}That's why you changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.52,0:46:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你接纳了伍德伯里的人\N{\rEng}why you brought those people from Woodbury in...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.22,0:46:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你接纳了他们  我们住在了一起\N{\rEng}You brought them in, and we all lived together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.58,0:46:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾是敌人\N{\rEng}We were enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.58,0:46:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你收起了枪\N{\rEng}You put away your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.43,0:46:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那么做是为了让我改变\N{\rEng}You did it so I could change,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.11,0:46:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了让我成为现在的我\N{\rEng}so I could be who I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.97,0:46:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那时做的事\N{\rEng}What you did then...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.03,0:46:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你停止了斗争\N{\rEng}How you -- How you stopped fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.96,0:46:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是对的\N{\rEng}it was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.47,0:46:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依然是对的\N{\rEng}It still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.92,0:47:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依然可以变成那样\N{\rEng}It can be like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.61,0:47:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你依然可以变成那样\N{\rEng}You can still be like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.17,0:47:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\rEng}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.09,0:47:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根  且慢\N{\rEng}Morgan, cease this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.74,0:47:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\rEng}Relent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.23,0:47:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀他是懦夫之举\N{\rEng}Ending him is the coward's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.76,0:47:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\rEng}We've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.58,0:47:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没必要杀他\N{\rEng}We don't have to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.08,0:47:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会看到他的恶行\N{\rEng}He will see what he has wrought,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.74,0:47:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些都将成为他的负担\N{\rEng}and all of it will be his to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.54,0:47:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能变回以前的我\N{\rEng}I can't be who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.54,0:47:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不同了\N{\rEng}It's different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.38,0:47:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能杀光他们  爸爸\N{\rEng}‭You can't kill all of 'em, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.17,0:47:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来一定有希望的\N{\rEng}There's gotta be something after.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.52,0:47:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你来说  对他们来说\N{\rEng}For you...and for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.17,0:48:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来一定有希望的\N{\rEng}There's gotta be something after.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.19,0:48:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根  住手\N{\rEng}Morgan, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.68,0:48:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想这样做  你不必这样做\N{\rEng}You don't want to do this. You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.41,0:48:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉过我  我们能比他们更好\N{\rEng}You told me we can be better than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.40,0:48:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你对我说的\N{\rEng}You said that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.97,0:48:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想这样做\N{\rEng}You don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.37,0:48:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  我能看出来\N{\rEng}I know it. I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.49,0:48:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\rEng}I have --
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.31,0:48:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须做\N{\rEng}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.17,0:48:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须做\N{\rEng}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.81,0:49:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  你现在看不到\N{\rEng}I know... you can't see it yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.21,0:49:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来的样子\N{\rEng}...how it could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.30,0:49:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我看到了\N{\rEng}But I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.38,0:49:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你蓄了胡\N{\rEng}You have a beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.08,0:49:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更长\N{\rEng}It's -- It's bigger...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.56,0:49:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更灰\N{\rEng}and grayer...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.46,0:49:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩很幸福\N{\rEng}Michonne's happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.34,0:49:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱迪思长大了\N{\rEng}Judith is older,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.53,0:49:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在听我以前听过的歌\N{\rEng}and she's listening to the songs that I used to before...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.28,0:49:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历山大扩张了\N{\rEng}Alexandria's bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.83,0:50:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有...\N{\rEng}There's --
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.25,0:50:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有新房子\N{\rEng}There's new houses...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.04,0:50:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,农作物\N{\rEng}crops...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.56,0:50:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们在工作\N{\rEng}and people working.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.62,0:50:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都在生活\N{\rEng}Everybody living...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.34,0:50:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮助其他人生活\N{\rEng}helping everybody else live.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.07,0:50:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能变回从前\N{\rEng}If you can still be who you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.60,0:50:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来就有可能变成那样\N{\rEng}that's how it could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.53,0:50:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能的\N{\rEng}It could.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.32,0:50:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.07,0:50:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是为了你\N{\rEng}It was all for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.36,0:50:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从一开始就是\N{\rEng}Right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.56,0:50:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在亚特兰大  农场\N{\rEng}Back in Atlanta, the farm --
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.73,0:50:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所做的一切  都是为了你\N{\rEng}everything I did, it was for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.05,0:51:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来在监狱  是为了你和朱迪思\N{\rEng}Then, at the prison, it was for you and Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.84,0:51:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在依然是  以后也会是\N{\rEng}It still is. It's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.23,0:51:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么能改变这点\N{\rEng}And nothing -- ‭nothing is gonna change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.35,0:51:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你拥有这样的未来  爸爸\N{\rEng}I want this for you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.05,0:51:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会实现的  卡尔\N{\rEng}I'm gonna make it real, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.31,0:51:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\rEng}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.93,0:51:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会实现的\N{\rEng}I'm gonna make it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.22,0:51:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\rEng}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.15,0:51:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\rEng}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.57,0:52:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\rEng}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.31,0:52:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看他  看我\N{\rEng}Don't look at him. You look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.11,0:52:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须做\N{\rEng}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.06,0:52:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该留在小屋的\N{\rEng}You were supposed to stay at the cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.83,0:52:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该做这个\N{\rEng}This wasn't what you were supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.31,0:52:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这不该你做  -卡萝尔\N{\rEng}- This wasn't for you. ‭- Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.99,0:52:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\rEng}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.62,0:52:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切自会解决\N{\rEng}All will be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.49,0:52:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切自会解决\N{\rEng}All will be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.92,0:52:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔  对不起\N{\rEng}Carl...I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.16,0:52:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没能保护好你\N{\rEng}I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.03,0:52:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲的责任是保护儿子\N{\rEng}A father's job is to protect his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.72,0:53:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱\N{\rEng}Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.05,0:53:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,责任只是爱\N{\rEng}It's just to love.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.01,0:53:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.39,0:53:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.63,0:53:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该...\N{\rEng}It -- It -- It...It should be --
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.65,0:53:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rEng}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.77,0:53:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该由你爱的人来\N{\rEng}Somebody you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.65,0:53:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你自己没法动手时\N{\rEng}When you can't do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.55,0:53:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我依然能动手\N{\rEng}But I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.96,0:53:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是大人了\N{\rEng}I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.29,0:53:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须动手\N{\rEng}I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.72,0:54:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己动手\N{\rEng}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.13,0:54:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\rEng}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.97,0:54:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\rEng}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.81,0:54:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  爸爸\N{\rEng}I love you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.32,0:54:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  卡尔\N{\rEng}I love you, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.65,0:54:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常爱你\N{\rEng}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.03,0:54:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会实现的\N{\rEng}I'll make it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.75,0:54:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\rEng}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.10,0:55:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\rEng}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.20,0:55:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\rEng}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.14,0:55:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好  亲爱的\N{\rEng}Well, good morning to you, darlin'.
